                                "sense_id": "c13a021c-1f7b-3184-9b35-1ef61ee12027",
                                "text": "Noche Flamenca, which returned to Theater 80 in the East Village last week for its summer season, does a pretty good job of all this even if its new program, “Aldaba,” is heavily weighted toward the rawly emotional side of flamenco, with mixed results."
